{"seq":27,"slug":"release-engineering","title":"发布工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.27,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 发布工程\n\n发布工程（Release Engineering）是将构建完成的软件制品安全、可靠地交付到生产环境的系统性工程实践。它关注的核心问题不是\"代码如何编译\"，而是\"版本如何命名、制品如何流转、发布如何治理\"。\n\n本 hub 与相邻知识域有明确分工。CI/CD 管道（ci-cd-pipelines）聚焦于代码变更触发的自动化构建与测试流水线——管道是发布工程的上游输入源；功能开关与渐进式发布（feature-flags-progressive-delivery）关注的是发布之后如何在运行时控制功能可见性——它是发布工程的下游消费者；Monorepo 工程（monorepo-engineering）解决的是多包/多服务在单一仓库内的代码组织——它影响版本策略但不等于版本策略本身。本 hub 占据中间地带：从 CI 管道产出制品开始，到制品通过治理审批进入生产为止。\n\n推荐学习路径按以下顺序展开：首先建立版本命名的心智模型（第一章），理解 SemVer、CalVer 的适用场景和分支模型的选择依据；然后进入发布流程的运营层面（第二章），掌握发布火车节奏、制品晋升管道和热修复应急机制；接着学习支撑这些流程的自动化工具链（第三章），包括 semantic-release、包注册中心管理和 Sigstore 签名体系；最后以治理与运营（第四章）收束，覆盖审批流程、回滚策略和发布健康度量。\n\n前置知识：读者应熟悉 Git 分支操作、CI/CD 基本概念（pipeline/stage/job）、容器镜像基础（OCI 格式、registry push/pull），以及 Conventional Commits 提交规范。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-strategy","title":"版本策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semver-calver-practices","title":"语义化版本与日历版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/semver-calver-practices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"branching-release-models","title":"分支与发布模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/branching-release-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"changelog-release-notes","title":"变更日志与发布说明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/changelog-release-notes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-process","title":"发布流程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-train-cadence","title":"发布火车与节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/release-train-cadence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"artifact-promotion-pipeline","title":"制品晋升管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/artifact-promotion-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hotfix-emergency-release","title":"热修复与紧急发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/release-process/hotfix-emergency-release"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-tooling","title":"自动化工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-automation-tools","title":"发布自动化工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/release-automation-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"package-registry-management","title":"包注册中心与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/package-registry-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-provenance","title":"签名与来源证明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/signing-provenance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-operations","title":"治理与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-governance-approval","title":"发布治理与审批","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-governance-approval"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-recovery-strategy","title":"回滚与恢复策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/rollback-recovery-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"release-metrics-health","title":"发布度量与健康指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-metrics-health"}]}]}